WEBVTT

00:00:00.447 --> 00:00:04.750
supplier exception A supplier exception is a request

00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:08.053
to depart from the organisation’s normal supplier requirements

00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:11.908
or process It still needs the appointed approver

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.421
executive access is not approval
